WEBVTT

01:32.040 --> 01:34.200
The Wuyang Army
is guarding outside the city.

01:34.280 --> 01:36.600
Why are you still here
to check the city's defense, General?

01:37.520 --> 01:40.480
I've followed His Majesty
to the south for a while now.

01:40.560 --> 01:41.880
Sometimes,

01:42.400 --> 01:44.560
I still miss the north.

02:02.920 --> 02:04.280
Have another look.

02:06.200 --> 02:07.080
-Look.
-I don't want it.

02:07.160 --> 02:08.880
-Let's go.
-Why are you buying so much?

02:08.960 --> 02:09.800
Move quickly!

02:09.880 --> 02:11.560
This is for nourishing
your body back home.

02:11.640 --> 02:13.360
-Let's go.
-Have a persimmon.

02:13.440 --> 02:15.120
Take a look.

02:15.200 --> 02:16.560
Don't miss out on this deal!

02:16.640 --> 02:18.280
Local persimmons!

02:19.000 --> 02:20.480
Pears!

02:20.560 --> 02:21.640
Three wen for a jin.

02:21.720 --> 02:22.680
Sir, do you want some pears?

02:22.760 --> 02:23.840
They are sweet.

02:23.920 --> 02:26.840
WANG PU, HUBEN MEMBER

02:26.920 --> 02:30.000
Miss, you are pretty and have smooth skin.

02:30.080 --> 02:31.600
I'm sure the pear is sweet.

02:31.680 --> 02:32.560
Absolutely.

02:35.400 --> 02:36.760
I only have one wen on me.

02:36.840 --> 02:38.880
Your mouth is sweeter than my pear.

02:38.960 --> 02:40.480
I'll sell it to you for one wen.

02:40.560 --> 02:41.680
Let me pick two big ones.

02:43.000 --> 02:43.960
Thank you.

02:44.800 --> 02:46.960
If I can marry someone as pretty and kind

02:47.040 --> 02:48.240
as you one day,

02:48.320 --> 02:49.640
I'd be blessed.

02:49.720 --> 02:50.800
You have a silver tongue.

02:53.760 --> 02:55.160
-Here you go.
-Sure.

02:55.240 --> 02:56.240
Come back again.

02:57.280 --> 02:59.240
Take another look.

02:59.320 --> 03:00.480
This is good.

03:01.280 --> 03:03.760
-Try more. Miss, take another one.
-No, thanks.

03:04.280 --> 03:05.120
Bamboo baskets!

03:05.720 --> 03:07.160
Take a look at my bamboo basket!

03:11.600 --> 03:12.640
Madam,

03:13.560 --> 03:14.880
your ribs look good.

03:14.960 --> 03:16.320
Yes. They are all fresh.

03:22.920 --> 03:23.920
I only have seven wen on me.

03:25.760 --> 03:28.440
Lamb offal only costs three wen.
Let me get you a jin of it.

03:31.880 --> 03:33.440
I'm not greedy

03:33.520 --> 03:34.640
but my wife

03:35.160 --> 03:36.600
is eight months pregnant now.

03:36.680 --> 03:37.960
She's going to give birth soon.

03:38.040 --> 03:40.840
However, I'm poor and cannot afford
to buy nourishment for her.

03:42.680 --> 03:43.800
Forget it.

03:44.440 --> 03:45.960
Here. Take it for seven wen.

03:48.000 --> 03:49.080
Thank you, madam.

03:53.600 --> 03:55.560
-Thank you, madam.
-Sure. Take care.

03:56.120 --> 03:56.960
All right.

04:00.960 --> 04:02.080
Sir!

04:04.040 --> 04:05.200
Do you want a coach ride?

04:05.280 --> 04:06.080
Where are you going?

04:06.160 --> 04:08.040
Northern foot of the Qinling Mountain,
Yulong Ridge.

04:08.120 --> 04:09.000
Seven wen.

04:11.720 --> 04:12.680
Sir,

04:14.440 --> 04:16.920
I shopped at the market
and bought many offerings.

04:18.120 --> 04:20.440
I only have three wen left.

04:20.519 --> 04:21.360
Offerings?

04:24.680 --> 04:26.800
I'm going to the mountains
to pay respects to my dead wife.

04:28.080 --> 04:29.440
She passed away three years ago.

04:31.920 --> 04:34.320
I purposely rushed
from the north to the Capital

04:34.400 --> 04:35.680
to pay respects to her.

04:37.680 --> 04:39.480
You're pitiful.

04:40.120 --> 04:40.960
Get on.

04:42.120 --> 04:42.960
Thank you.

04:47.520 --> 04:49.200
-We are leaving.
-All right!

05:13.360 --> 05:14.360
Sir,

05:14.440 --> 05:15.960
did you come to the wrong place?

05:16.480 --> 05:18.200
This place is full of mountains.

05:18.280 --> 05:19.120
There's no grave here.

05:19.200 --> 05:20.720
She isn't buried here.

05:21.520 --> 05:22.520
She died here.

05:23.680 --> 05:25.680
Three years ago,
she was on a journey at night

05:26.360 --> 05:28.680
and she encountered bandits.

05:34.000 --> 05:35.640
Forget it. Keep it.

05:35.720 --> 05:37.160
You're in the wilderness.

05:37.240 --> 05:39.920
You need money to take a carriage back.

05:42.840 --> 05:44.000
Thank you, sir!

05:46.520 --> 05:47.560
Thank you!

06:16.840 --> 06:18.160
Everyone, you've worked hard.

06:18.680 --> 06:20.880
Later, I'll request that the general

06:21.520 --> 06:22.480
arranges more manpower

06:23.160 --> 06:24.800
so you'll get fewer shifts.

06:52.200 --> 06:53.720
I am Wang Pu,

06:54.720 --> 06:56.240
General Fengshan's messenger.

06:56.760 --> 06:57.760
I have been asked

06:58.560 --> 06:59.680
to come see you.

07:00.520 --> 07:02.600
Huben sent someone here again?

07:19.040 --> 07:21.360
Does Yan Fengshan
have something to tell me?

07:21.440 --> 07:22.920
Yes. Of course.

07:23.960 --> 07:25.560
General Fengshan wants me

07:25.640 --> 07:27.200
to improve your meal.

07:51.040 --> 07:52.960
Is Liu Ziyan dead?

07:55.720 --> 07:57.000
What a fine prediction, sir.

07:59.360 --> 08:02.080
-He is indeed dead.
-Who killed him?

08:06.720 --> 08:07.920
There were many people.

08:08.520 --> 08:11.120
As soon as he left here,
he fought nonstop.

08:11.200 --> 08:12.840
He was wounded in every fight

08:12.920 --> 08:14.840
and finally died in the wilderness.

08:15.520 --> 08:17.720
Even the sharpest blade breaks in the end.

08:20.560 --> 08:22.720
I heard he had served you for three years.

08:23.320 --> 08:25.000
It's an honor

08:25.920 --> 08:26.960
he's remembered by you.

08:30.800 --> 08:31.720
Served me?

08:32.960 --> 08:35.640
Liu Ziyan was the best assassin of Huben.

08:35.720 --> 08:38.799
He would never serve anyone.

08:40.280 --> 08:42.760
He was there to kill me.

08:44.720 --> 08:47.400
However, he was very cautious.

08:48.120 --> 08:50.080
We spent day after day together,

08:50.720 --> 08:51.960
and through our interactions,

08:52.720 --> 08:54.920
he probed me for three years.

08:55.520 --> 08:58.360
But he couldn't find a chance to kill me.

08:58.960 --> 09:01.320
An assassination that lasted three years?

09:02.240 --> 09:05.360
No wonder even General Fengshan

09:05.960 --> 09:07.160
called Liu Ziyan

09:07.760 --> 09:09.240
a blade that no one could wield.

09:13.480 --> 09:16.200
I hear you can kill
with anything in this world.

09:16.800 --> 09:19.120
No one in this world can match you.

09:20.000 --> 09:21.960
Liu Ziyan was biting off
more than he could chew.

09:34.000 --> 09:35.040
Sir.

09:39.880 --> 09:41.480
The general did not ask me to kill you.

09:41.560 --> 09:42.720
I'm not that brave either.

09:44.000 --> 09:45.240
The soup isn't poisoned.

10:10.480 --> 10:12.920
The Wuxi Mountain is covered in snow,

10:13.760 --> 10:16.280
and there's a vast grassland below it.

10:17.160 --> 10:18.720
This is the taste

10:19.640 --> 10:21.040
of the lamb that lived there.

10:22.040 --> 10:23.680
You boiled it in water

10:24.840 --> 10:26.040
and added a pinch of salt.

10:28.920 --> 10:29.920
Young man,

10:31.000 --> 10:32.760
have you been there?

10:33.520 --> 10:34.640
No.

10:35.200 --> 10:36.240
I came from the city.

10:37.400 --> 10:38.760
I bought the lamb in the city.

10:41.040 --> 10:43.080
The person who went to your homeland

10:43.880 --> 10:45.240
was General Fengshan.

10:48.720 --> 10:52.320
He said that place had 200,000 men
ready to fight in a battle.

10:52.400 --> 10:54.320
Anyone would fear that place.

10:55.240 --> 10:56.120
Right now,

10:56.200 --> 10:58.080
even the lamb of Wuxi Mountain

10:58.160 --> 10:59.960
can be bought in Chang'an.

11:00.040 --> 11:02.400
That means the world is at peace.

11:03.000 --> 11:04.760
If you stay here,

11:06.040 --> 11:07.320
the world

11:07.400 --> 11:09.680
will remain at peace.

11:10.560 --> 11:13.400
Go back and relay a message
to Yan Fengshan.

11:14.080 --> 11:15.400
Tell him

11:16.080 --> 11:17.240
that I prefer

11:19.600 --> 11:22.040
the tea of Chang'an now.

11:47.840 --> 11:50.840
Still no word of Yan Fengshan?

11:53.400 --> 11:56.600
Looking for one person in this world

11:56.680 --> 11:58.600
is like looking for a needle
in a haystack.

11:59.480 --> 12:03.040
Moreover, you're looking
for the world's best shadow guard.

12:03.880 --> 12:05.040
It won't be that easy.

12:06.000 --> 12:07.640
You failed your task.

12:08.160 --> 12:11.200
Yet here you are,
playing weiqi with me in a carefree manner

12:11.800 --> 12:13.680
and even surrounding my pieces.

12:14.520 --> 12:16.640
I failed my task indeed

12:16.720 --> 12:18.480
but my skill at weiqi is good.

12:18.560 --> 12:20.520
With it,

12:20.600 --> 12:22.960
my life remains safe before Your Majesty.

12:36.080 --> 12:38.000
If you were Yan Fengshan,

12:38.080 --> 12:39.880
what would you do next

12:40.960 --> 12:42.720
after abducting the deposed emperor?

12:44.320 --> 12:46.880
With the emperor in hand,
one can order every marquis around.

12:46.960 --> 12:48.480
Everyone knows that.

12:48.560 --> 12:50.560
Since the founding emperor's time,

12:50.640 --> 12:51.760
regional commanders were appointed.

12:51.840 --> 12:54.440
Everyone has military power.

12:55.040 --> 12:57.720
These four places, Beiting, Fanyang,

12:57.800 --> 13:00.400
Long'an, and Zhenxi are the strongest.

13:01.320 --> 13:02.880
If I was Yan Fengshan,

13:02.960 --> 13:05.040
I would try to win them over.

13:05.720 --> 13:07.000
Or, perhaps

13:07.720 --> 13:10.000
I've already won them over.

13:11.240 --> 13:13.640
As my greatest enemy,

13:14.240 --> 13:16.800
you'd best not let me ally with them.

13:26.600 --> 13:29.400
If I take away the military authority
of these four commanders,

13:29.480 --> 13:31.160
it will be pointless

13:31.920 --> 13:33.480
even if he allies with them.

13:39.520 --> 13:40.640
You won't be able to do that.

13:42.320 --> 13:44.240
The four of them

13:44.320 --> 13:45.560
used to serve the founding emperor.

13:46.400 --> 13:47.880
They are still loyal.

13:47.960 --> 13:49.680
They won't give in so easily.

13:50.200 --> 13:52.600
Your Majesty, you need another plan.

13:52.680 --> 13:53.800
Then devise it.

13:55.240 --> 13:56.680
You failed your task already.

14:03.480 --> 14:05.120
Your Majesty, you have an army.

14:05.760 --> 14:07.360
They also have their army.

14:08.000 --> 14:09.120
I also have an army.

14:10.480 --> 14:12.840
Summon the four regional
military commanders to the Capital.

14:12.920 --> 14:14.800
I will relinquish
my military authority to you

14:15.800 --> 14:17.560
in front of them.

14:18.160 --> 14:20.560
In this way, you are also forcing them
to hand over their authority.

14:24.200 --> 14:27.120
But the Baiwenhu Army
is your family's private army.

14:28.760 --> 14:31.160
If there's no war in this world,

14:31.240 --> 14:33.800
my family no longer needs our own army.

14:34.320 --> 14:35.960
We only need servants.

14:37.920 --> 14:39.960
Your selflessness

14:40.040 --> 14:42.680
shows how scheming I am.

14:44.400 --> 14:46.280
Sure. I'll accept your suggestion.

14:46.920 --> 14:48.800
Hand over your military command,

14:49.440 --> 14:51.200
and you may take the seat

14:51.280 --> 14:52.560
behind me.

14:55.400 --> 14:56.920
I am a cripple.

14:59.520 --> 15:01.600
I prefer sitting in a wheelchair.

15:05.720 --> 15:07.800
Just do as I say

15:08.320 --> 15:10.600
so Yan Fengshan
will have no way out of this.

15:14.040 --> 15:15.240
I'll do as you say as well.

15:16.640 --> 15:18.840
Moreover, there's one more thing

15:18.920 --> 15:20.880
that I want to ask you, Your Majesty.

15:22.120 --> 15:24.240
Han Ziling whom I chose initially

15:24.320 --> 15:26.720
was killed by Your Majesty.

15:28.000 --> 15:29.960
Was the person Your Majesty
chose after that

15:31.360 --> 15:32.720
White Hair?

15:36.440 --> 15:38.040
White Hair?

15:39.600 --> 15:41.960
I haven't heard this name for so long.

15:44.040 --> 15:46.200
That's right. It was him.

15:46.720 --> 15:48.600
The last person of the Liu family.

15:49.280 --> 15:52.440
His father founded the Huben Army.

15:52.520 --> 15:54.360
Using him to defeat the Huben Army

15:56.000 --> 15:57.000
is the most suitable choice.

16:02.880 --> 16:05.720
I know a bit
about what befell the Liu family.

16:06.480 --> 16:08.080
It's not easy

16:08.160 --> 16:10.440
for a child of that age
to escape the Huben Army's pursuit

16:10.520 --> 16:11.640
and survive.

16:12.440 --> 16:14.440
He was born with white hair.

16:14.520 --> 16:15.880
As he grew up,

16:16.600 --> 16:18.920
his hair slowly turned black.

16:19.440 --> 16:22.000
Someone who was born with rare traits

16:22.080 --> 16:23.360
won't die so easily.

16:24.120 --> 16:26.760
Were you friends in the past?

16:28.480 --> 16:29.640
We were.

16:31.880 --> 16:33.120
I hope

16:34.400 --> 16:35.760
to meet him again.

16:36.760 --> 16:39.040
Taking away military authority

16:40.040 --> 16:42.000
will leave Yan Fengshan with no way out.

16:43.000 --> 16:44.960
He hands over the Baiwenhu Army

16:45.840 --> 16:47.760
so Your Majesty will have no worries.

16:48.360 --> 16:50.640
Gu Yu is very aware of the bigger picture.

16:51.600 --> 16:52.920
Someone like him

16:53.720 --> 16:54.840
is rare.

16:55.520 --> 16:57.480
Do you think he won't realize

16:57.560 --> 16:59.720
this is all a part of our scheme?

17:01.600 --> 17:03.560
It is my scheme.

17:04.280 --> 17:06.480
He won't hold it against Your Majesty.

17:48.600 --> 17:50.760
What are you doing today?

17:51.360 --> 17:52.400
What's wrong?

17:54.480 --> 17:56.000
Aren't we using someone else's residence?

17:56.080 --> 17:57.680
You should add more furniture

17:57.760 --> 17:59.240
and clean the place.

17:59.760 --> 18:02.200
After all, we have to live our lives here.

18:03.600 --> 18:04.680
Living our lives?

18:05.560 --> 18:08.000
What? Are you cooking tonight
so I can relax?

18:08.520 --> 18:10.800
I can't do that. My cooking is bad.

18:10.880 --> 18:12.080
Your noodles taste better.

18:12.160 --> 18:13.520
You can cook for now.

18:13.600 --> 18:14.560
Once I learn from you,

18:14.640 --> 18:16.080
I'll be in charge of both of your meals.

18:16.160 --> 18:17.480
By the time you learn how to cook,

18:17.560 --> 18:19.480
I will be 60 years old.

18:19.560 --> 18:20.600
Enough. Stop fussing.

18:20.680 --> 18:21.640
I just finished sweeping.

18:22.400 --> 18:23.600
Go and wash the bowls.

18:26.240 --> 18:27.840
Sure. I'll go and wash the bowls.

18:27.920 --> 18:29.400
Remember to cook the noodles later.

18:47.760 --> 18:48.600
Huai'an.

18:49.440 --> 18:51.080
Are we going

18:51.720 --> 18:53.200
to keep living in the house

18:53.720 --> 18:54.560
Bai Wan lent us?

18:55.600 --> 18:57.080
Before she left,

18:58.320 --> 18:59.800
she left this place to me

19:01.840 --> 19:03.560
because she wanted someone

19:04.800 --> 19:05.920
to keep this house lived-in.

19:14.280 --> 19:15.960
Every time I see his face,

19:17.880 --> 19:19.520
it'll remind me of Zhang Mo.

19:23.120 --> 19:24.720
But the real Zhang Mo is…

19:29.440 --> 19:30.480
We

19:32.440 --> 19:33.800
all have to move on.

19:36.440 --> 19:37.640
I can't kill him,

19:38.720 --> 19:40.800
yet I need him to stay by my side.

19:45.440 --> 19:47.800
I need to get along with him
in another way.

20:02.240 --> 20:03.320
Come in.

20:17.200 --> 20:18.200
Speak.

20:20.920 --> 20:22.600
TO YANNIANG

20:33.240 --> 20:36.080
Today, I wrote a letter.

20:36.920 --> 20:39.080
I want to send it
to Zhang Mo's family at Huzhou.

20:39.680 --> 20:40.800
In the letter,

20:40.880 --> 20:43.320
I said I had made enough dowry
for the daughter,

20:43.920 --> 20:45.920
but business
had been very good in the Capital.

20:46.000 --> 20:47.760
Therefore, I said wanted to stay

20:47.840 --> 20:48.760
and make more money.

20:49.720 --> 20:50.920
I've only written one letter.

20:51.440 --> 20:53.000
I hope

20:53.720 --> 20:55.520
my wife and children
can put their minds at ease.

20:59.440 --> 21:00.480
That said,

21:01.440 --> 21:03.840
I tried to copy Zhang Mo's handwriting.

21:04.760 --> 21:06.040
I don't know how well I did.

21:06.760 --> 21:08.560
I hope you can check it for me.

21:12.480 --> 21:13.760
Why are you doing this?

21:17.960 --> 21:18.960
I want to atone.

21:20.760 --> 21:22.320
It's the loss of a life.

21:22.400 --> 21:23.840
How do you atone for it?

21:24.440 --> 21:25.760
I'll atone with my life then.

21:26.400 --> 21:28.320
Aren't you going to use me
to defeat Yan Fengshan

21:28.400 --> 21:29.760
and the Huben Army?

21:29.840 --> 21:31.480
When you think of a way,

21:32.200 --> 21:33.080
send me.

21:37.920 --> 21:39.600
Liu Ziyan is dead.

21:40.520 --> 21:42.960
Qingyi has also been captured.

21:43.560 --> 21:46.160
They've lost
two great Huben leaders in the city.

21:47.000 --> 21:48.520
Yan Fengshan

21:49.360 --> 21:51.040
will surely act again.

21:55.960 --> 21:58.240
When the Huben Army causes trouble again,

21:59.240 --> 22:00.920
it'll be our chance for a breakthrough.

22:01.800 --> 22:02.840
Perhaps,

22:03.520 --> 22:04.720
you'll be useful.

22:05.320 --> 22:06.200
I understand.

22:07.360 --> 22:08.840
When the day comes,

22:10.000 --> 22:11.200
I won't blink

22:13.000 --> 22:14.520
even if I die.

22:22.880 --> 22:24.000
Leave the letter.

22:29.560 --> 22:30.680
You may leave.

22:30.760 --> 22:33.200
If the handwriting is similar enough,

22:33.280 --> 22:34.400
I'll send the letter.

23:20.160 --> 23:21.320
Speaking of which,

23:21.400 --> 23:25.000
there's a scholar
at the Lide Ward in Luoyang.

23:25.080 --> 23:26.520
His surname is Wang.

23:26.600 --> 23:28.360
We'll call him Wang Sheng for now.

23:28.960 --> 23:29.960
He loves to drink.

23:30.040 --> 23:32.280
He must drink a few cups every day.

23:32.360 --> 23:36.480
One day, he was drunk again.

23:36.560 --> 23:38.560
He wobbled back home,

23:38.640 --> 23:41.720
lay on his bed, and fell asleep.

23:41.800 --> 23:44.680
When he was sleeping, one of his hands

23:46.120 --> 23:48.240
touched the ground.

23:48.320 --> 23:49.680
His wife saw it…

23:49.760 --> 23:50.640
SHAN, BAIWENHU MEMBER

23:50.720 --> 23:51.880
…and feared he'd catch a chill,

23:51.960 --> 23:53.880
so she quickly approached him

23:53.960 --> 23:55.280
to tuck his hand

23:55.360 --> 23:57.960
back into his bed.

23:58.680 --> 24:00.160
When his wife

24:00.240 --> 24:03.240
was about to touch Wang Sheng's hand…

24:04.520 --> 24:05.760
Suddenly!

24:08.480 --> 24:09.480
Why did you shout?

24:10.560 --> 24:12.000
I thought you weren't afraid.

24:12.080 --> 24:12.920
I'm not afraid.

24:13.760 --> 24:15.160
All right. You are not afraid.

24:15.240 --> 24:17.400
Give me your hand then. Give it to me.

24:19.200 --> 24:20.280
Let me grab it.

24:21.760 --> 24:22.600
Suddenly,

24:22.680 --> 24:25.440
a large hand reached out from underground

24:25.520 --> 24:27.720
and grasped Wang Sheng's hand.

24:27.800 --> 24:29.800
It started pulling him underground.

24:29.880 --> 24:31.520
It kept pulling.

24:32.200 --> 24:33.680
His wife was afraid

24:33.760 --> 24:35.080
and called for help.

24:35.160 --> 24:37.440
Someone! Save my husband!

24:37.520 --> 24:40.440
Her neighbors came to help her

24:40.520 --> 24:41.720
and they saw Wang Sheng

24:41.800 --> 24:43.400
was about to be pulled underground
like this.

24:43.480 --> 24:45.200
They quickly tried to fish him out.

24:45.280 --> 24:47.320
Wang Sheng, come out!

24:48.040 --> 24:51.800
It was useless.
The large hand was too powerful

24:51.880 --> 24:54.920
and it dragged Wang Sheng underground.

24:56.560 --> 24:58.760
That's… Just like that,

24:58.840 --> 25:02.120
Wang Sheng was pulled underground
and became a wandering spirit.

25:02.720 --> 25:05.080
His wife couldn't eat and drink

25:05.160 --> 25:06.960
because she missed her husband.

25:07.040 --> 25:08.760
One night,

25:09.480 --> 25:11.120
his wife had a dream.

25:11.720 --> 25:12.680
She saw

25:13.280 --> 25:15.480
her husband coming back
to find her at night.

25:16.080 --> 25:17.480
He approached her.

25:18.000 --> 25:21.640
He got closer and closer.

25:21.720 --> 25:22.920
Suddenly!

25:28.000 --> 25:29.720
Didn't you say you weren't afraid?

25:32.320 --> 25:33.280
You're so annoying.

25:33.360 --> 25:34.320
Wait, what's that smell?

25:34.400 --> 25:35.640
-Something is burnt.
-The porridge!

25:35.720 --> 25:36.560
-The porridge!
-Hurry!

25:36.640 --> 25:38.600
-The porridge.
-The porridge smells nice.

25:40.960 --> 25:41.960
-General!
-General!

25:42.480 --> 25:44.200
All of you are enjoying your meal.

25:44.280 --> 25:47.000
I'm sure you haven't forgotten your duties
to guard the city walls as well.

25:50.760 --> 25:53.680
The general is busy with official matters.
He toils all day long.

25:53.760 --> 25:55.760
He only returns to his residence
to rest at midnight.

25:55.840 --> 25:57.320
Passing the walls

25:57.400 --> 25:59.080
he heard your chatter and laughter.

25:59.160 --> 26:00.120
It was so lively.

26:00.720 --> 26:03.880
If news of this spreads, the reputation
of Baiwenhu Army's strict discipline

26:03.960 --> 26:05.360
will be just a joke.

26:09.040 --> 26:10.200
General.

26:10.280 --> 26:13.080
While it is true
that I slack and eat a lot,

26:13.160 --> 26:16.120
this was mainly because Shan was hungry

26:16.200 --> 26:19.040
so I gathered everyone

26:19.120 --> 26:20.320
to have some porridge.

26:20.400 --> 26:21.440
I was wrong.

26:21.520 --> 26:23.600
Please punish me.

26:24.200 --> 26:25.360
What did you do wrong?

26:27.800 --> 26:28.760
I…

26:28.840 --> 26:31.360
I know the Huben Army
is still in the city.

26:31.440 --> 26:33.200
But I paid them no mind

26:33.280 --> 26:35.880
and even fooled around with Shan.

26:35.960 --> 26:36.960
No.

26:38.040 --> 26:39.360
Your mistake

26:41.200 --> 26:42.920
is that you're having porridge here

26:43.000 --> 26:44.400
without inviting me.

26:47.720 --> 26:48.960
Right.

26:49.040 --> 26:52.120
Why didn't any of you
invite the general to eat porridge?

26:52.200 --> 26:53.800
Get up quickly
and invite the general over.

26:53.880 --> 26:55.480
General, please come here.

26:55.560 --> 26:56.920
-General, over here.
-Come.

26:57.000 --> 26:59.280
All of you were screaming and shouting.

26:59.360 --> 27:00.800
You were telling ghost tales again.

27:00.880 --> 27:02.680
No. We were joking.

27:03.440 --> 27:04.800
Shan is timid.

27:04.880 --> 27:07.880
Pangtou, you shouldn't bully
and scare him.

27:07.960 --> 27:09.680
I was just horsing around.

27:11.680 --> 27:14.000
General, I am a Baiwenhu member.

27:14.080 --> 27:15.160
I'm not afraid of ghosts.

27:16.400 --> 27:17.960
General, it's like this.

27:18.800 --> 27:20.600
We are sharing ghost stories

27:20.680 --> 27:22.720
to make this place lively

27:22.800 --> 27:24.560
so everyone can be happy.

27:25.160 --> 27:26.160
I didn't mean to scare them.

27:27.080 --> 27:28.960
Pangtou is great at livening the mood.

27:29.720 --> 27:31.360
My apologies.

27:31.440 --> 27:32.360
I spoiled the mood.

27:32.440 --> 27:33.520
Not at all.

27:33.600 --> 27:34.880
Fine. I'll take a drink as punishment.

27:34.960 --> 27:36.160
No need.

27:36.240 --> 27:38.080
There's no wine.
I'll take a sip of porridge.

27:38.160 --> 27:39.120
Sure.

27:40.280 --> 27:41.680
General!

27:41.760 --> 27:42.880
-It's hot.
-Hot!

27:43.520 --> 27:45.320
You scared us this time.

27:46.160 --> 27:47.360
-Everyone.
-Come.

27:47.440 --> 27:48.840
-Everyone.
-Come.

27:48.920 --> 27:50.400
Come.

28:08.480 --> 28:09.320
Mister.

28:10.080 --> 28:12.320
Where have all the sellers gone to?

28:12.400 --> 28:15.080
My mother wants me
to buy two jin of pork shoulder.

28:16.440 --> 28:18.520
Something good will happen tonight.

28:20.200 --> 28:21.040
You want pork shoulder?

28:22.880 --> 28:23.920
Let me help you.

28:50.560 --> 28:51.640
Little boy,

28:52.160 --> 28:53.040
go home now.

28:53.680 --> 28:54.680
Later,

28:55.920 --> 28:57.080
there'll be absolute chaos.

29:11.760 --> 29:13.000
-Be careful!
-Yes.

29:13.880 --> 29:15.520
-Here.
-Move the general to the brick path

29:15.600 --> 29:16.640
so it's easier to push.

29:21.680 --> 29:23.880
I've told you to use the lift.

29:24.880 --> 29:26.120
What are you talking about?

29:26.200 --> 29:27.320
I had fun chatting with you.

29:27.400 --> 29:29.440
Bringing you down is fine.

29:29.520 --> 29:30.640
Yes.

29:32.640 --> 29:34.280
It's late at night now.

29:34.360 --> 29:35.760
When the sun rises,

29:35.840 --> 29:37.000
all of you

29:37.560 --> 29:39.320
should return to camp and sleep well.

29:40.680 --> 29:42.200
-Farewell, General.
-Farewell, General.

29:57.760 --> 29:58.600
It's rare for me

29:59.480 --> 30:01.200
to see you smiling
since you entered Chang'an, General.

30:02.800 --> 30:04.720
I grew up in the army.

30:04.800 --> 30:08.880
Naturally, I'll feel more relaxed
being with the soldiers.

30:10.680 --> 30:14.000
Later, I inherited the title

30:14.080 --> 30:15.640
and took command of the military.

30:16.560 --> 30:18.520
I live beside the emperor.

30:19.600 --> 30:22.640
I have no choice
but to show another facade to others.

30:24.120 --> 30:25.920
General, your position demands that you

30:26.000 --> 30:27.120
uphold many standards.

30:27.640 --> 30:29.120
You can hardly be relaxed.

30:29.760 --> 30:30.800
It won't be long.

30:32.920 --> 30:35.040
The regional military commanders
enter the Capital next month.

30:35.880 --> 30:37.280
According to the plan,

30:37.800 --> 30:39.640
I will also hand over
my military authority.

30:40.920 --> 30:42.800
Once the commander
of the Baiwenhu Army changes,

30:43.520 --> 30:44.960
I'll be free.

30:45.760 --> 30:46.760
General…

30:47.360 --> 30:49.240
Xiao Wuyang

30:49.320 --> 30:51.440
is a trustworthy emperor.

30:52.440 --> 30:55.880
When the other commanders and I
give him our seals,

30:56.400 --> 30:57.720
the fight for power will be no more.

30:58.320 --> 31:00.200
With no way out for Yan Fengshan,

31:00.920 --> 31:03.280
the battle won't happen.

31:04.080 --> 31:05.120
Then,

31:06.040 --> 31:08.160
no one will die.

31:15.760 --> 31:17.240
How unlucky.

31:17.320 --> 31:19.320
I still need to wash the dishes.

31:30.000 --> 31:30.920
Pangtou?

31:33.400 --> 31:35.120
Are you trying to scare me again?

31:40.360 --> 31:42.400
We are under attack!

31:43.960 --> 31:45.680
It's an ambush!

32:03.160 --> 32:04.040
I recognize that.

32:04.120 --> 32:06.000
That's Baiwenhu's arrow of command.

32:45.640 --> 32:47.440
-Hurry!
-Yes!

32:55.200 --> 32:56.600
-Throw them down.
-Yes.

33:27.640 --> 33:28.760
Let's go.

33:44.200 --> 33:45.280
There are so many of them.

33:45.880 --> 33:47.280
This is so cruel.

33:47.800 --> 33:49.760
All these human lives!

33:51.240 --> 33:52.320
I wonder who did this.

33:56.320 --> 33:57.160
General.

34:03.440 --> 34:04.920
Help me get down.

34:06.800 --> 34:07.720
Don't look.

34:08.560 --> 34:09.800
It's fine. Don't be afraid.

35:10.080 --> 35:10.920
There are assassins!

35:13.640 --> 35:14.640
Run! Protect the general!

35:14.720 --> 35:15.960
Yes!

35:39.240 --> 35:40.320
Stop!

35:40.840 --> 35:42.440
-General!
-General!

35:46.440 --> 35:49.640
Are you the one who killed my soldiers?

35:50.320 --> 35:51.480
Yes.

35:55.840 --> 35:57.560
I did this tonight

35:58.600 --> 35:59.800
because I want

35:59.880 --> 36:01.480
you to come with me, General Gu.

36:01.560 --> 36:02.360
General!

36:03.160 --> 36:04.280
Stop!

36:05.960 --> 36:07.200
I don't want to kill him.

36:09.320 --> 36:10.520
In a while,

36:10.600 --> 36:12.360
I will send General Gu back.

36:13.040 --> 36:16.200
Before that, I hope the Baiwenhu Army

36:16.280 --> 36:18.360
won't do anything reckless.

36:18.880 --> 36:20.480
Otherwise,

36:21.200 --> 36:22.880
when General Gu returns,

36:24.520 --> 36:26.400
he won't return merely crippled.

36:27.600 --> 36:29.760
Are you aware of the consequences?

36:52.360 --> 36:54.880
Your Majesty. General Gu was attacked.

37:33.080 --> 37:35.880
Gu Yu is an old acquaintance of mine.
I came here

37:36.680 --> 37:38.400
to save Gu Yu.

37:39.040 --> 37:40.280
I underestimated the enemy.

37:41.680 --> 37:45.040
I should have
protected the general fiercely

37:46.000 --> 37:47.120
and not left him.

37:48.600 --> 37:50.560
Given what the Huben Army did tonight,

37:52.280 --> 37:54.640
Gu Yu wouldn't have been safe

37:57.280 --> 37:58.760
even if Xiao Wuyang were beside him.

38:00.360 --> 38:01.200
Don't worry.

38:01.920 --> 38:03.200
I have my own way

38:03.720 --> 38:04.760
of rescuing Gu Yu.

38:05.640 --> 38:07.040
Right now,

38:07.640 --> 38:09.320
the only place to hide Gu Yu

38:11.160 --> 38:12.840
is Hidden Soldier Alley.

38:32.440 --> 38:33.960
I wanted to meet His Majesty

38:34.040 --> 38:35.280
but seeing you suffices, Chancellor Gao.

38:36.520 --> 38:38.680
Hearing that Gu Yu was being attacked,

38:38.760 --> 38:39.760
His Majesty wanted to leave the palace

38:40.360 --> 38:41.760
but I stopped him.

38:42.760 --> 38:44.000
Well done.

38:44.080 --> 38:45.360
Just in case it's another trap.

38:49.680 --> 38:50.840
How's your injury?

38:53.320 --> 38:54.600
I'm fine.

38:55.720 --> 38:57.040
Qingyi has been captured

38:57.120 --> 38:58.360
and Liu Ziyan is dead.

38:58.440 --> 39:01.560
You fended off Huben alone. Well done.

39:02.160 --> 39:03.400
I didn't make the wrong choice

39:03.920 --> 39:04.920
by choosing you.

39:05.800 --> 39:07.320
But losing Gu Yu

39:08.720 --> 39:10.000
is a loss.

39:12.040 --> 39:14.440
The regional military commanders
enter the Capital next month.

39:15.200 --> 39:16.680
According to Gu Yu's plan,

39:17.280 --> 39:20.000
he will first hand over
the military command of the Baiwenhu Army.

39:20.520 --> 39:22.440
That act will also prompt

39:22.520 --> 39:24.280
the other commanders
to yield their command.

39:25.080 --> 39:27.440
Then, Yan Fengshan

39:27.520 --> 39:29.280
will have no one to ally with.

39:30.440 --> 39:32.440
It is a good move indeed.

39:32.520 --> 39:34.040
In that case,

39:35.440 --> 39:37.040
you need to make sure

39:37.560 --> 39:38.840
the move succeeds.

39:38.920 --> 39:41.000
You mustn't let Gu Yu defect,

39:41.600 --> 39:43.240
even if it means killing him.

39:49.480 --> 39:51.720
Chancellor Gao, you sure are devoted

39:52.320 --> 39:54.480
to securing His Majesty's dynasty.

39:57.200 --> 39:58.480
But Chancellor Gao,

39:59.520 --> 40:00.720
don't forget.

40:01.880 --> 40:03.640
Gu Yu is a general.

40:04.640 --> 40:06.160
When a soldier bleeds,

40:06.960 --> 40:08.400
he will take revenge.

40:10.320 --> 40:12.440
He will never defect to the Huben Army.

40:16.560 --> 40:18.440
That's for the best.

40:22.280 --> 40:24.040
I am an old acquaintance of Gu Yu.

40:24.120 --> 40:26.800
If I'm going to rescue him,
I will protect him forever.

40:27.440 --> 40:29.960
But once the military
authority issue settles down,

40:30.840 --> 40:32.200
I hope you don't

40:32.880 --> 40:35.200
abandon those who help you,
Chancellor Gao.

40:38.800 --> 40:40.080
Perhaps I will,

40:42.000 --> 40:42.920
perhaps I won't.

41:18.600 --> 41:19.760
Nasty One.

41:21.040 --> 41:22.200
Nasty One!

41:24.240 --> 41:25.320
You're the nasty one.

41:26.320 --> 41:27.160
Collect the laundry.

41:29.640 --> 41:30.720
How annoying.

41:30.800 --> 41:32.480
I've noticed it now.

41:33.000 --> 41:37.800
Life is just work upon work, without rest.

41:39.280 --> 41:40.880
What's wrong with you today?

41:40.960 --> 41:43.080
Weren't you all fired up a few days ago?

41:43.160 --> 41:44.520
Why so down all of a sudden?

41:45.400 --> 41:47.720
That was a few days ago.

41:47.800 --> 41:49.760
This is me right now.

41:50.440 --> 41:52.600
Perseverance is a virtue, young man.

41:55.440 --> 41:56.280
I'm leaving as well.

42:01.520 --> 42:02.560
Where are you going?

42:03.160 --> 42:04.560
Gu Yu has been taken by Huben.

42:05.160 --> 42:06.400
If I'm not mistaken,

42:07.080 --> 42:09.320
they will imprison him
at Hidden Soldier Alley.

42:09.840 --> 42:12.360
So, I need to infiltrate
Hidden Soldier Alley

42:13.200 --> 42:14.520
to rescue Gu Yu.
